{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在無綫節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽分享了「咖喱醃椰菜花」的做法。醃菜其實並不複雜，這道食譜準備過程簡單，椰菜花口感清爽，並帶有獨特的咖喱香氣，是一道既消暑又開胃的家庭冷盤。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa26834b-4d99-4b4d-8a34-1537bd12d34d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20264W2AhIKBwa1784283164.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa26834b-4d99-4b4d-8a34-1537bd12d34d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>咖喱醃椰菜花所需材料</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰菜花</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">昆布水</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醋（與昆布水比例約一比一）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜頭</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">檸檬汁</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">糖</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">咖喱粉</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>烹飪步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將椰菜花切好並汆水，隨後放涼備用。</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將放涼後的椰菜花放入乾淨的玻璃瓶內。</p></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9c2b0b36-5166-4072-b4c5-98feacafc4f1.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266AuHvb2HsB1784283157.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9c2b0b36-5166-4072-b4c5-98feacafc4f1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T16:37:54.846406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}